### ========================================
### COMPLETE BOOKING FLOW TEST
### From Login to Payment
### ========================================

### 1. Register User (if not exists)
POST http://localhost:3000/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama_pelanggan": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login User
POST http://localhost:3000/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

# Save the token from response and use it in subsequent requests
# Example: @token = <paste_token_here>

### 3. Get All Films (Browse Films)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/films

### 4. Get Specific Film Details
GET http://localhost:3000/api/films/1

### 5. Get Jadwal for Specific Film (Select Schedule)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/jadwal?id_film=1

### 6. Get Jadwal by ID with Seat Availability (Select Seats)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/jadwal/1

### 7. Get Payment Methods (Payment Page)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/metode-pembayaran

### 8. Create Order (Submit Booking)
POST http://localhost:3000/payment/order
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6NSwiZW1haWwiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlckBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJVU0VSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzY5MDA2NDYxLCJleHAiOjE3Njk2MTEyNjF9.8XUJ9E1rX1ltnbnHYky8owplWpAIPsoy9_iXKC49jGc

{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "id_jadwal": 86,
      "id_kursi": 1924,
      "id_tipe_hari": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 9. Process Payment
POST http://localhost:3000/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <paste_your_token_here>

{
  "id_order": 1,
  "id_metode_pembayaran": 1
}

### 10. Get User Tickets (My Tickets)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/my-tickets
Authorization: Bearer <paste_your_token_here>

### ========================================
### ALTERNATIVE FLOW - Check Specific Resources
### ========================================

### Get All Cabang (Branches)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/cabang

### Get All Studios
GET http://localhost:3000/api/studios

### Get Tipe Hari (Day Types)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tipe-hari

### Get Aturan Harga (Price Rules)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/aturan-harga

### Get Specific Price for Cabang + Tipe Studio + Tipe Hari
GET http://localhost:3000/api/aturan-harga/specific?id_cabang=1&id_tipe_studio=1&id_tipe_hari=1

### ========================================
### ADMIN ENDPOINTS (Requires Admin Token)
### ========================================

### Admin Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@cinema.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Create Multiple Jadwal with Multiple Time Slots
POST http://localhost:3000/api/jadwal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <paste_admin_token_here>

{
  "id_film": 1,
  "id_studio": 1,
  "tanggal": "2026-01-25",
  "jam_tayang": [
    {
      "jam_mulai": "12:00",
      "jam_selesai": "14:30"
    },
    {
      "jam_mulai": "15:00",
      "jam_selesai": "17:30"
    },
    {
      "jam_mulai": "18:00",
      "jam_selesai": "20:30"
    }
  ]
}

### ========================================
### COMPLETE BOOKING FLOW EXAMPLE
### Step by Step with Sample Data
### ========================================

### STEP 1: Login as User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

# Response will contain: { "token": "eyJhbGc...", "user": {...} }
# Copy the token and use it below

### STEP 2: Browse Films
GET http://localhost:3000/api/films

# Pick a film, note the id_film (e.g., 1)

### STEP 3: Get Schedules for Selected Film
GET http://localhost:3000/api/jadwal?id_film=1

# Response shows all schedules with:
# - tanggal, jam_mulai, jam_selesai
# - studio info (cabang, tipe_studio)
# - harga_tiket (price per ticket)
# - tipe_hari (day type)

### STEP 4: Get Seat Availability for Selected Schedule
GET http://localhost:3000/api/jadwal/1

# Response shows:
# - Film details
# - Studio details with all kursis (seats)
# - statusKursis (seat status: TERSEDIA, DIPESAN, TERJUAL)
# - seatAvailability (total, available, occupied)
# - harga_tiket

### STEP 5: Create Order with Selected Seats
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "id_jadwal": 1,
      "id_kursi": 5
    },
    {
      "id_jadwal": 1,
      "id_kursi": 6
    }
  ]
}

# Response will contain:
# - id_order
# - kode_order (order code)
# - total_harga (subtotal)
# - biaya_layanan (service fee: 2500)
# - grand_total (total to pay)
# - expired_at (payment deadline: 15 minutes)
# - tikets array with kode_tiket for each ticket

### STEP 6: Get Payment Methods
GET http://localhost:3000/api/metode-pembayaran

# Pick a payment method, note the id_metode_pembayaran

### STEP 7: Process Payment
POST http://localhost:3000/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

{
  "id_order": 1,
  "id_metode_pembayaran": 1
}

# Response will contain:
# - Payment details
# - Virtual Account number or QR code (if applicable)
# - Order status updated to PAID
# - Ticket status updated to CONFIRMED

### STEP 8: View My Tickets
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/my-tickets
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# Response shows all user's tickets with:
# - kode_tiket (ticket code)
# - Film details
# - Schedule details (date, time)
# - Seat details (row, number)
# - Status (PENDING, CONFIRMED, CANCELLED)

### ========================================
### ERROR SCENARIOS TO TEST
### ========================================

### Try to book already sold seat
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "id_jadwal": 1,
      "id_kursi": 1
    }
  ]
}

# Should return error if seat is already TERJUAL or DIPESAN

### Try to pay expired order
POST http://localhost:3000/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
  "id_order": 999,
  "id_metode_pembayaran": 1
}

# Should return error if order is expired or not found

### Try to create jadwal with conflicting time slot
POST http://localhost:3000/api/jadwal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>

{
  "id_film": 1,
  "id_studio": 1,
  "tanggal": "2026-01-25",
  "jam_tayang": [
    {
      "jam_mulai": "12:00",
      "jam_selesai": "14:30"
    }
  ]
}

# Should return 409 conflict if time slot already exists
